### Electron Version

42.0.0

### What operating system(s) are you using?

Linux

### Expected Behavior

On Linux/X11, selecting an existing directory and pressing Open should resolve canceled:false and its path. Actual: canceled:true with filePaths:[]. I already read #810202, which describes these exact observations. I am filing my independently tested version.

### Minimal reproduction

Save as main.js and run `electron main.js`.

```js
const { app, dialog } = require('electron');
app.whenReady().then(async () => {
  const result = await dialog.showOpenDialog({ properties: ['openDirectory'] });
  console.log(result);
  app.quit();
});
```

